% EXOZIPPy universal reference library.
%
% Shipped as package data and copied VERBATIM next to every generated
% <prefix>_paper.tex -- never subset: bibtex selects the cited entries
% itself, and uncited entries cost nothing (they may be handy later).
%
% Keys follow the Author:Year convention already used in the code
% (table_note's Chen:2017).  Every \cite*{...} key emitted anywhere in the
% codebase (prose sentences, table_notes, PriorContribution strings) must
% have an entry here -- tests/test_prose.py cross-references them
% statically, so add the entry in the same commit as the sentence.
%
% Entries were fetched from doi.org (crossref) content negotiation and
% cleaned by hand: ASCII-only (LaTeX escapes for accents), print-issue
% years where crossref reported online-first years, real titles where IOP
% metadata was ALL CAPS.  A % comment above each entry says what it is
% cited for.

